      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BEFORE  -  157s\n\ntest job + separate image job:\nBazel started twice, image rebuilt\n\n~50 wheels + Python re-extracted\nevery run (~25s)\n\n13s symlink scan + 15s gzip\nwhen packing the productpage layer",
      "originalText": "BEFORE  -  157s\n\ntest job + separate image job:\nBazel started twice, image rebuilt\n\n~50 wheels + Python re-extracted\nevery run (~25s)\n\n13s symlink scan + 15s gzip\nwhen packing the productpage layer",
