      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AFTER  -  67s  (warm caches)\n\none build job: test -> load -> scan\non one Bazel server\n\nBazel's whole external dir cached\n(actions/cache)\n\nvenv made at runtime: no symlink scan,\nzstd instead of gzip\n\npush split out: main only, after scans",
      "originalText": "AFTER  -  67s  (warm caches)\n\none build job: test -> load -> scan\non one Bazel server\n\nBazel's whole external dir cached\n(actions/cache)\n\nvenv made at runtime: no symlink scan,\nzstd instead of gzip\n\npush split out: main only, after scans",
