      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "bazel test //productpage/... //ratings/...\n    all unit + image tests (image tests need Docker)\n\nbazel run //productpage:load\n    build the image -> Docker: bookinfo-productpage:ci\n\nbazel run //ratings:push -- --tag dev\n    push (after docker login ghcr.io)\n\nimages build on Linux x86_64 only;\non a Mac use docker compose (Dockerfiles kept)",
      "originalText": "bazel test //productpage/... //ratings/...\n    all unit + image tests (image tests need Docker)\n\nbazel run //productpage:load\n    build the image -> Docker: bookinfo-productpage:ci\n\nbazel run //ratings:push -- --tag dev\n    push (after docker login ghcr.io)\n\nimages build on Linux x86_64 only;\non a Mac use docker compose (Dockerfiles kept)",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
